         """Compute multi-modal inputs with image and video."""
+        # EchoSonarVideo patch (external/verl-hf-rollout-registry.patch): this project's
+        # EchoPrimeAgentLoop (packages/echoprime_track/echoprime_agent_loop.py) has `self.processor is None` --
